            <div xml:id="m-5b669900-5fc3-4e8a-9153-ed997ec22b36">
              <lg xml:id="m-0481c47b-d87e-4d09-b4a1-267f9d6c06d3">
                <l xml:id="m-e1ed3199-f2f2-47d2-9383-3ae92b1d0ee3" facs="#m-8ad4f361-f0cb-40aa-a27c-a3c50085e437" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms at the Little Hours</l><l xml:id="m-e4743da3-e166-4501-ae7c-33f17c041ec1" facs="#m-2adc8c81-0c9d-47a2-a619-3fe18bb4a711" label="lyrics-like">11. Exsúrge, glória méa, exsúrge psaltérium et cithara: “exsúrgam</l><l xml:id="m-20c782f2-da91-4243-95d8-c3fa7a1a3750" facs="#m-893d5474-fdb1-4d09-a9d3-0bf1fc7f21e3" label="ambiguous">ailuculo.</l><l xml:id="m-eab170a7-a6ab-407d-b493-c6872ab4dcdd" facs="#m-b1009874-2da4-4324-8be8-50c35c9c8118" label="lyrics-like">12. Confitébor tibi in pópulis, Dómine:“et psálmum dícam tibi</l><l xml:id="m-e45a7f3a-02ee-4400-9a64-d63e6523f5e6" facs="#m-8acd5bba-b2f1-46e5-b5d2-c061ba090cf5" label="ambiguous">in gentibus:</l><l xml:id="m-275179b1-0883-41a6-9016-96edd5f7d641" facs="#m-c80c867d-339f-4a5a-8f50-c45b6d730220" label="lyrics-like">13. Quóniam magnificáta est úsque ad caélos misericórdia túa,</l><l xml:id="m-2f623a42-961a-4b22-80df-8af8ec9d8170" facs="#m-528b9f28-483e-4630-9c61-2e605bf0eb27" label="lyrics-like">et úsque ad núbes véritas túa.</l><l xml:id="m-09f0a25f-5d28-4fde-8fea-5f6d03c4bc2b" facs="#m-83be48c4-9322-4283-a728-caef0960db9a" label="lyrics-like">14. Exaltáre super caélos, Déus: super ómnem térram glória</l><l xml:id="m-540de4e1-f608-48be-8f72-84de6dd0ea83" facs="#m-1e0ff2ae-4d10-41e9-bc90-d30e9894c2cc" label="lyrics-like">túa.</l><l xml:id="m-98d6e130-be34-40be-a5ab-9d149c2c6662" facs="#m-58d7416c-54b6-40ec-a4ff-59907e43ad71" label="ambiguous">Psalm 57.</l><l xml:id="m-2c30a208-6a15-4101-bf7d-1e2fcedaa3f0" facs="#m-a6bf96ee-c256-42bb-981f-66893c347ccc" label="lyrics-like">VI vére útique justitiam loquímini :*récta judicâte, filii hóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-33c207d1-27c0-4ec5-8a9b-94b795030dc7" facs="#m-715d9fca-97db-45f8-b337-f05c0eee8a12" label="lyrics-like">2. Etenim in córde iniquitátes operámini:“in térra injustitias</l><l xml:id="m-b5b8878d-a4aa-4499-83f7-7bb379bcc86b" facs="#m-ef4e9890-40e1-4c0f-957e-3240210e6239" label="lyrics-like">mánus véstrae concinnant.</l><l xml:id="m-f45635ea-02f6-4a8e-a0a3-f1bb6eda9280" facs="#m-696b943d-5f21-4972-ac84-870c06e6c883" label="lyrics-like">3. Alienáti sunt peccatóres a vúlva, erravérunt ab útero:“locúti</l><l xml:id="m-7677c0e4-a01e-450a-a210-2d56f57b002c" facs="#m-bdea454b-c61b-4988-b87b-3654d737b1f7" label="lyrics-like">sunt fálsa.</l><l xml:id="m-e5dc9f2b-7ecb-4805-9229-3c1ce97b48c6" facs="#m-62e4e0a6-a050-4f67-82f3-19b7fbc46b1f" label="lyrics-like">4. Furor illis secúndum similitúdinem serpéntis: “ sicut áspidis</l><l xml:id="m-582dad16-2768-4abf-8162-837a826bc538" facs="#m-c7c5c4bc-248d-4390-aef3-a9eba3b7641f" label="lyrics-like">súrdae, et obturántis áures súas.</l><l xml:id="m-6205442b-08f9-4e6f-ba17-6714c1733b4a" facs="#m-a9dfe62c-e34a-43a0-86a3-b0a031294d49" label="lyrics-like">5. Quae non exáudiet vócem incantántium:“ venéfici incan¬</l><l xml:id="m-15bf6c53-72a2-41ed-b065-51bf3f883523" facs="#m-83693d7a-6a7e-4292-87bc-848b0ea0888a" label="lyrics-like">tántis sapiénter.</l><l xml:id="m-a19e04e2-1772-465c-bde7-6e08b3d065d7" facs="#m-4c8d2911-0e74-4cc9-a7f3-1ac496bc94a9" label="lyrics-like">6. Déus cónteret déntes eórum in ore ipsórum:“mólas leónum</l><l xml:id="m-4db49a73-02da-4aed-8515-40cfdca1f02e" facs="#m-f1d96c01-ddb5-41cc-b339-026d201cb287" label="lyrics-like">confringet Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-b349eed6-0413-49ed-b69d-bab366c8df1f" facs="#m-2a3ebb48-2c35-4bf1-b574-7f228d7c0336" label="lyrics-like">7. Ad nihilum devénient tamquam áqua decúrrens:inténdit</l><l xml:id="m-e0cd420f-0d68-451d-961a-c93c835615f5" facs="#m-fa4b18a1-1897-47c6-aebc-bddddc6b3346" label="lyrics-like">árcum súum dónec infirméntur.</l><l xml:id="m-1491e2bd-06ef-4413-89b2-98f199f6c4ed" facs="#m-8b12cbdd-47ea-4131-a019-65465e9bf605" label="lyrics-like">8. Sicut céra quaé fluit, auferéntur:ercécidit ignis, et non</l><l xml:id="m-9aaa8678-59fc-4a23-88c1-0123e546dd4e" facs="#m-eab048fa-43ce-4927-b046-0001c27bd0f4" label="lyrics-like">vidérunt sólem.</l><l xml:id="m-f4994d2c-057e-44dd-9b36-dfe05a3ef873" facs="#m-feb6e161-cd35-4098-84df-d40bf7a4bb45" label="lyrics-like">9. Priúsquam intelligerent spinae véstrae rhámnum: “sicut vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-7657a603-f3ab-46b5-9ae2-a20bcf641381" facs="#m-2005a551-42e0-40c5-bc02-2dd02eb27a15" label="lyrics-like">véntes, sic in ira absórbet éos.</l><l xml:id="m-7508b7f2-49cd-43c1-8676-803bc6fabe7c" facs="#m-312a501d-c2f5-453b-8c09-e0920775e7f4" label="lyrics-like">10. Laetábitur jústus cum viderit vindictam:us súas lavábit</l><l xml:id="m-96c5ec8f-4d10-4b63-878b-c57572e092e3" facs="#m-ac6c76ef-a87a-4ec1-a0a5-9ddf6ef98633" label="lyrics-like">in sánguine peccatóris.</l><l xml:id="m-93127729-5377-4a92-86ff-acd968966e21" facs="#m-6a6b8f36-d0b3-4ac9-8cf1-c1ba3a7dc8b5" label="lyrics-like">11. Et dicet hómo: Si útique est frúctus jústo:“útique est Déus</l><l xml:id="m-2b9b499c-7ed4-49b6-9bbb-62c65ba2c8c8" facs="#m-911b2e4f-8a54-4a63-8513-d4b078d007b7" label="lyrics-like">júdicans éos in térra¬</l><l xml:id="m-cd93a2ae-ab9e-4359-8d75-2df87c20a339" facs="#m-94bf02d2-2910-47a8-895a-1bb18547236e" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e52a79f-dbf4-4249-8606-ed9c256cfcce" facs="#m-d4676203-149c-466d-abb3-b3f9f25e6a13" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-19e0374d-312e-4e4c-9bd1-56753f2c4cda" facs="#m-03cb37b9-7c04-4cbe-85cd-931b47fc3572" label="lyrics-like">In Dé-spe-rá-vi, non timébo quid fá-ci-at mí hi</l><l xml:id="m-7eb04d25-80b6-45a7-a5cb-efd100ee1662" facs="#m-a599e907-2c4b-4e39-b9a3-e49a56670c59" label="lyrics-like">hómo.</l><l xml:id="m-4b8a5e2d-f918-4ee4-8832-03e0939cb142" facs="#m-ecf944a9-a3ab-448a-ad84-1830d133a412" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant Alleltia, alleluia, allelúia. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-ea1b677b-6bb6-47d8-95ce-b37c4500ce78" facs="#m-51599ea1-7476-4a39-a597-5ad1b7d0d101" label="text-like">WEDNESDAY AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-13be3b24-f920-4983-ab19-822d325c473e" facs="#m-96a11bcf-ea1b-47c4-8f69-62f0b1d62d19" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-70ebb570-5106-455a-8e8e-ac51b57888af" facs="#m-6a210356-36c5-4ff8-9cf5-c79e0aa0c021" label="ambiguous">3.b</l><l xml:id="m-e89442c3-e162-40d2-ad61-db36d9ba9054" facs="#m-38ed40a8-c13f-4727-8015-8430fac9425d" label="lyrics-like">DE-us mé-us. E u o u a</l><l xml:id="m-52aa0850-5ac2-4fc8-ac56-b1b8df09a51c" facs="#m-a7159dcf-f203-4de8-8d19-94fc334b4a68" label="ambiguous">e.</l><l xml:id="m-37338ee6-b84c-4255-a03f-c22cbae98397" facs="#m-73d203b1-5f77-43c9-9c2c-e435c595add2" label="text-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Alleluia. P. 246.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>